## Validation Checklist (What the Implementation Must Enforce)

| Guard | Where | 
|---|---|
| Bundle price > ₦500 | `createCourseBundle` action |
| All courses belong to the same tutor | `createCourseBundle` action |
| All courses are `PUBLISHED` | `createCourseBundle` + `beginBundleCheckout` |
| Bundle has ≥ 2 courses | `createCourseBundle` action |
| Student not enrolled in ANY bundle course | `beginBundleCheckout` action |
| Bundle is still `isActive` at checkout | `beginBundleCheckout` action |
| Tutor cannot buy their own bundle | `beginBundleCheckout` action |
| Bundle slug is unique and URL-safe | `createCourseBundle` action |

