> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Recommendation**: Approve this revised approach. The key insight is that **a bundle is just a curated, discounted multi-course cart with a fixed split rate** — we don't need new payment infrastructure, we need a thin wrapper around the existing checkout that enforces the bundle's price and split. This cuts the implementation surface area by ~40% and eliminates the risk of divergent payment paths.
